</p><p>清如冰碧，洁如霜露，轻贱世俗，高立独步，此士之次也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>（《文选》卷四十二曹植《与杨德祖书》注）<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p><p>节操凌高云。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>（《文选》卷四十五石崇《思归引序》注）<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
