</p><p>警跸清夷。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>（《文选》卷四十六王融《三月三日曲水诗序》注）<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
